Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-First Episode\NThe Secret Letter
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, I see that\Nfor some time now...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...you do nothing but read\Nletters, instead of studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that you have\Nduties toward yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.70,0:02:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and toward your rank!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we will study mathematics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mathematics is a\Nvery important subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The first school of\Nmathematics was established...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...by the Greek\Nmathematician Archimedes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.06,0:02:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was established by the\NGreek mathematician Pythagoras.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.66,0:02:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well! I\Nwas testing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.18,0:02:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it was Pythagoras!\NEveryone knows that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Letter for the Princess\Nfrom Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.62,0:02:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Present arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.78,0:03:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away! Go away!\NGo away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! You are the kindest dog\Nthat I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.42,0:03:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go, I'm finished, Gol.\NTake it to her immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.14,0:03:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But why isn't Gol coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, I can't wait anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.26,0:04:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- What the devil is wrong with him? - The Prince\Nis a bit strange these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.58,0:04:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He is always sitting\Nbehind the desk reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Reading? Studying, you mean!\NMy nephew is a serious person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.98,0:04:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He is preparing\Nto become a King.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is this? A letter?\NBut what does it mean? Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But why is there a heart drawn on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A heart?\NThen it's a love letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.78,0:04:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I deduce that my nephew is in love.\NAnd why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All young people fall in love,\Nsooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.86,0:04:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There is really no reason\Nto worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who the girl could be\Nwho has won his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is what I'm being told true,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,that lately there have been\Nsecret contacts...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...between the kingdom of Silverland\Nand that of Goldland?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.86,0:05:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! There is a little dog that often\Ncrosses our border!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the two countries are secretly\Nconspiring to invade us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is! There he is! It's the dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, it's really him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.22,0:05:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He is carrying in his mouth\Na letter all in silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.34,0:05:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It must certainly be a secret message\Nsent by those from Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch that dog and bring it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.22,0:05:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.18,0:05:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good! Well done, little dog!\NBravo! You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this dog alone,\Nif you value your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, everything is fine
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What a striking man!\NDad, tell me who he is right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Prince Franz of Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz...\NWhat a beautiful name!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:07:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How much I like him!\NI love him, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I absolutely want to marry him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.74,0:07:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to become his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.02,0:07:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I want him! I want him! I want him!\NAnd I will have him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it away! Take it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say I want a cake! I\Nsaid I want to marry Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, and no again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say that I want\Na doll! I hate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a husband who is\Nalive! I want Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.02,0:07:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want these things\Nthat you are bringing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to marry Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.58,0:07:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do\Nanymore to keep her calm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.46,0:07:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you let her\Nmarry Prince Franz of Goldland?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.14,0:07:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- But you are...!\N- Yes, it's really me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have just arrived\Nfrom Village X.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you to offer your daughter\Nin marriage to Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.22,0:08:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He will refuse,\Nbecause he is in love with Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus you can say that his refusal\Nis an insult to your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be an excellent excuse for you\Nto finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...attack and destroy\Nthat cursed kingdom of Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he were to accept,\Nyou could always invite him here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...to be able to kill him\Nby treachery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.70,0:08:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But however things go, thanks\Nto this providential marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.06,0:08:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,we will seize Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Union X has decided to get rid\Nof the cursed kingdom of Goldland.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It is giving us too much trouble\Nto the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And Silverland is giving us\Ntoo much trouble to the North.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,North...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.70,0:08:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it is up to you to choose:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,either you side with us\Nand help us destroy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...the kingdoms of Goldland\Nand Silverland,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,or you stand against us\Nand then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...you will meet the same end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.74,0:09:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I had never noticed that\Nhe was in love with her specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.18,0:09:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I was also\Nrather surprised...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...since Princess Teggy,\Nthe only daughter of the King of Charcoaland,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.94,0:09:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,offered to marry\NPrince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the letter with the heart...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.42,0:09:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The letter with the heart had been\Nwritten by Princess Teggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to tell me, uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.82,0:09:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, listen!\NI have wonderful news to give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The young Princess to whom\Nyou have written all these days
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.86,0:09:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- is being offered to you in marriage!\N- Is it true? You're not kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you think, uncle?\N- You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell you that I definitely approve\Nand that I would approve of any girl
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,...whom you truly loved!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.14,0:09:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to thank you, uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Gol, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.42,0:10:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire..\NBe patient, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we will get married
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful moon tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Franz is also\Nlooking at the moon and thinking of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my beloved Franz..
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The King of Charcoaland and his daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.46,0:11:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! The Princess,\Nmy Princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- She must have already arrived!\N- Wait a moment, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.78,0:11:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You must present yourself to your\Nbride dressed elegantly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.02,0:11:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I am truly sorry\Nfor having kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There were some unforeseen circumstances
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.46,0:11:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My nephew Franz\Nwill be here any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He seemed intimidated\Nby this meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet he must have loved you\Nfor a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.42,0:11:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,His Grace, Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But you are...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm Teggy! I'm happy\Nthat you remember me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think of nothing else but you, you know?\NI think of you day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you! I love you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you more than my father\Nand more than my mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,more than cake and dolls!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you more than all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Teggy... You don't know...\NYou can't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.90,0:12:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, what you are saying is not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I know everything, Franz!\NEverything I need to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.06,0:12:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't! Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Forgive me, Teggy! And forget me!\N- Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Father!\N- Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He has insulted my honor!\NHe has insulted my country,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,therefore I declare war on Goldland\Nto avenge the insult!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.90,0:13:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Father!\N- War to the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.30,0:13:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! Let go of me!\NI don't want this, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.70,0:13:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I don't want this! Franz! Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My God, what have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.46,0:14:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.10,0:14:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The river of Goldland has been\Ncrossed by the enemy army!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.86,0:14:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle to the west of Goldland\Nhas fallen into enemy hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.94,0:14:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Our garrison has been destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.26,0:14:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They are attacking too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.22,0:14:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The King of Charcoaland's army\Nwas already ready to go to war!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.66,0:14:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I am convinced that the\Nmarriage offer was just a trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They set a trap for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.74,0:14:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't take action, the\Nkingdom of Goldland will be defeated...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...and all the people will be\Nkilled. We must do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.46,0:14:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We will fight until the end\Nfor the honor of Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We must fight and hope\Nthat a miracle saves us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.94,0:15:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gol! Come, Gol!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gol, take this letter\Nimmediately to Princess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, don't get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.46,0:15:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A letter for Prince\NSapphire from Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.62,0:15:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gol!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.90,0:15:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! The King of Charcoaland\Nhas invaded the kingdom of Goldland?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They invaded Goldland?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s all because of my\Nnegligence, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.34,0:16:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s true that I broke Teggy’s\Nheart, but I did it for love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.78,0:16:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must go to the fortress,\Nin the North, to save my country.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, don’t worry about\Nme, I will do everything I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not come to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were to come here, Silverland\Nwould also be involved in this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.46,0:16:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! My poor, beloved Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.26,0:16:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea! Gol, run\Nimmediately to help Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will follow you shortly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him immediately to\Nthe Black Knight’s spirit castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.30,0:16:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end of Goldland!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.78,0:17:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz is a prisoner\Nin that castle, isn’t he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.02,0:17:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:17:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am also looking for\NPrince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:18:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help him!\NTake me with you, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.26,0:18:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But... But your country is at war\Nwith Goldland, it seems to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Aren't you sworn enemies?\N- I don't care at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.90,0:18:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My father is a petty man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I love Prince Franz! Let's go\Nhelp him, let's not waste time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, come with me, but don't\Nmake me waste time! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Cursed vampires of the darkness!\NYou won't drink my blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.86,0:19:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look down!\NLook up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep climbing!\NDon't look down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.10,0:19:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Goldland will be in our\Nhands in less than a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.14,0:19:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll destroy Silverland too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you on our side for\Nthis other venture as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But certainly!\NYou can count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to join\Nmy army!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll exploit him\Na bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.06,0:19:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"Exploit people as long as\Npossible and then throw them away"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.06,0:19:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the law of\NUnion X, our philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:20:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see if I don't\Ntell my father everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.26,0:20:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, first of all, we\Nmust find Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.74,0:20:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me, but be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.54,0:20:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done!\NHurray for the phantom knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.50,0:20:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo! Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.66,0:20:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.18,0:20:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.06,0:20:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How romantic it is\Nto be saved by you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.90,0:20:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But first we must save Franz,\Nbefore it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! Franz, take heart!\NWe have come to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.78,0:20:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is the voice of my...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.74,0:21:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come in here! In here\Nthere are the vampires of the darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz! I've come to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.18,0:21:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!\NI owe you my life once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.02,0:21:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.10,0:22:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how handsome the phantom\Nknight is! How much I like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll fall in love with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.90,0:22:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you so much,\Nphantom knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.30,0:22:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,for saving Franz and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.62,0:22:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm running home right away\Nto tell my father everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.86,0:22:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so he will put a stop to\Nthis stupid war!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.10,0:22:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There is another thing I want to tell you:\NI want to marry you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Franz,\Nbut I think everything is fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,because you love Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.18,0:23:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, forgive me, but it's\Nreally true what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.54,0:23:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I love Sapphire. I love\Nher with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.62,0:23:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's the matter?\N- Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.78,0:23:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't explain it to you now. You\Nwill understand when you are older.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.02,0:23:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, but will you wait\Nuntil I have grown up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.54,0:23:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.50,0:23:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, phantom knight! I love\Nyou! I love you! I love you so much!
